        "Isolates will be tested for susceptibility to macrolide antibiotics using routine clinical testing.",
        "Refer to Core Protocol documents for criteria for the discontinuation of participation in this trial.",
        "Specific isolates may be referred to a reference laboratory according to current clinical practice.",
        "• SAE as defined in Core Protocol" ;
